The [[Squirrel Archer]] is an item normally obtainable by combining the [[Squirrel]] with the [[Shortbow]]. The [[Squirrel]] is only available to [[Ranger]]s with [[Big Bowl of Treats]]. The [[Squirrel Archer]] does the same damage as the [[Shortbow]] (but attacks slower), with the added benefit of costing no stamina, and still has the effect of [[Squirrel]], but faster. It's therefore a strict [[Squirrel]] upgrade and arguably a [[Shortbow]] upgrade as well. 

